<title>POLAND: RAFAKO INCREASES LOSS IN MARCH.</title>
<headline>RAFAKO INCREASES LOSS IN MARCH.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net loss		 6.13 vs   1.23</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   6.13 vs   1.30</p>
<p> Operating loss	 4.74 vs   0.02 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   22.76 vs  37.65</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net loss		 7.51 vs   1.57 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   7.51 vs   2.71 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 5.31 vs   5.78 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   77.39 vs  98.03</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish boilermaker is Fabryka Kotlow</p>
<p>Rafako SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
